        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created by Michel van der Aa</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Award-winning composer and director Michel van der Aa brings his passion for innovative narrative forms to the digital realm. HERE offers a unique blend of cinema and interactive performance. Users can shape the narrative, creating a personalized experience that explores the boundaries of reality and identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This launch comes fresh off Michel van der Aa's win for Best Immersive Work at Cannes International Film Festival 2025 for his latest VR creation &quot;From Dust.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HERE makes cutting-edge music theater accessible to a diverse audience, including those who might not typically attend traditional venues. Using VR on your PC, this app offers a fresh way to engage with contemporary performance, bridging the gap between creator and audience in the comfort of your own space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a virtual grand theater and be captivated by Julia Bullock's stunning aria from the acclaimed film opera &quot;Upload.&quot; Immerse yourself in &quot;Eight,&quot; the groundbreaking VR opera installation that has wowed audiences at festivals around the world, soon available in your living room. Explore &quot;The Book of Sand,&quot; a VR adaptation of Jorge Luis Borges' novel that pushes the boundaries of digital storytelling. And that's just the beginning...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HERE is produced by the doubleA foundation with support from DigitALL and Fonds Podiumkunsten.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created by Michel van der Aa</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Award-winning composer and director Michel van der Aa brings his passion for innovative narrative forms to the digital realm. HERE offers a unique blend of cinema and interactive performance. Users can shape the narrative, creating a personalized experience that explores the boundaries of reality and identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This launch comes fresh off Michel van der Aa's win for Best Immersive Work at Cannes International Film Festival 2025 for his latest VR creation &quot;From Dust.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HERE makes cutting-edge music theater accessible to a diverse audience, including those who might not typically attend traditional venues. Using VR on your PC, this app offers a fresh way to engage with contemporary performance, bridging the gap between creator and audience in the comfort of your own space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a virtual grand theater and be captivated by Julia Bullock's stunning aria from the acclaimed film opera &quot;Upload.&quot; Immerse yourself in &quot;Eight,&quot; the groundbreaking VR opera installation that has wowed audiences at festivals around the world, soon available in your living room. Explore &quot;The Book of Sand,&quot; a VR adaptation of Jorge Luis Borges' novel that pushes the boundaries of digital storytelling. And that's just the beginning...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HERE is produced by the doubleA foundation with support from DigitALL and Fonds Podiumkunsten.</p>",
        "short_description": "Step into the future of immersive storytelling with HERE, a groundbreaking app for PCVR that brings music theatre into your home.",
